# Cloudberry's isolation2_expandshrink_schedule (src/test/isolation2), as the
# port runs it on a coordinator and three segments, with a mirror for each
# and a standby, through the isolation2 suite's harness: M8's gpexpand and
# gpshrink.
#
#   run   the test runs here, in both passes; cloudberry/ holds a difference
#         reviewed and kept, where one pass has one.  The third word is the
#         group, whose name begins "mirrors", so that the harness makes its
#         cluster with a mirror for each segment, as Cloudberry's demo
#         cluster has.
run  gpexpand_gpshrink                             mirrors_expand
